Hi,<div> I am trying to repeat an activity by rollback a certain number of times, if activated. But the whole process should be repeated only a fixed number of times. For example, in total the activity should be repeated 10 times (= &quot;remaining_replication&quot; at the beginning). The &quot;remaining_replication&quot; was defined at the beginning as =-10, as it is only possible to sum up within the setting function. Each time the function is activated, the activity is repeated 3 times. But for the fourth activation of the function, the activity shall be repeated only once, to have in total 10 replications. I tried to set a new attribute in two different options, but this does not work. The function is part of several connected functions.</div><div><br></div><div><br>work_func &lt;-function (name, envs,<br>                      usual_replication,<br>                      activate_next){<br>  <br>  name&lt;-trajectory(&quot;name&quot;)%&gt;%<br>    <br>    <br>    set_global(&quot;delivery&quot;, 1, mod=&quot;+&quot;)%&gt;%   <br>    <br>    seize(&quot;resource&quot;, 1) %&gt;%<br>   </div><div>  <br>    #option 1<br>    set_attribute(&quot;replication &quot;, function() min (usual_replication, -1*get_global(envs, &quot;remaining_replication&quot;)))%&gt;%<br>    <br>    #option 2<br>    set_attribute (&quot;

replication   &quot;, function () <br>      ifelse (get_global(envs, &quot;

remaining_replication  &quot;)*-1 &lt;  

usual_replication  , get_global(envs, &quot;

remaining_replication  &quot;)*-1, 

usual_replication  )) %&gt;% <br>    <br>    <br>    <br>    log_(&quot;activity&quot;)%&gt;%<br>    timeout(function() rnorm (1, 10, 0)) %&gt;%  <br>    <br>    rollback(2, get_attribute(envs, &quot;replication&quot;)) %&gt;%  <br>    <br>    set_global(&quot;remaining_replication&quot;,  function() min (usual_replication, -1*get_global(envs, &quot;remaining_replication&quot;))), mod=&quot;+&quot;)%&gt;%<br>  <br>  <br>    release(&quot;resource&quot;, 1) %&gt;%<br>  <br>    log_(function() paste(&quot;Delivery:&quot;, get_global(envs, &quot;delivery&quot;), &quot;finished&quot;)) %&gt;%<br>  <br>    activate (activate_next)<br><br>}<br><br><br></div>
